OWN-WORLD: Existing Bonfire dark surfaces, Bricolage display, warm orange and pale yellow accents.
STORY: Recognise reader demand, see Jacobin, understand the engagement, book a project conversation.
FIRST VIEWPORT: Spacious proposition beside a real Jacobin screenshot; project CTA and price context.
FORM: Extension of Ghost/Mosaic's established site grammar, with case evidence before service scope. -->
